<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - International Rectifier.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - International Rectifier.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney cut its rating on International Rectifier Corp to neutral from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 3-1/8 at 14-7/8.</p>
</text>
